# DuckDB's extension statements and Pondra's UNINSTALL, answered the same on every form (ADR-075 §6): a built-in name is a
# notice, another name is refused by name, and an extension that isn't installed can't be uninstalled.
statement ok
INSTALL httpfs

statement error 0A000
INSTALL nope

statement error 42704
UNINSTALL nope
